{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c8e8637a-d59f-411f-94cd-5448360154e3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Variable\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### A variable is a container that stores a value, which can be changed during the execution of a program.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### Rules\n",
    "#### >It can contain letters, numbers, and underscores.\n",
    "#### >Spaces are not allowed.\n",
    "#### >Variable names are case-sensitive (age and Age are different).\n",
    "#### >Keywords cannot be used as variable names, such as if, for, while, class, etc"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "593bdaaa-c519-4192-a7c3-7cbaebef2754",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Hari 20 5.8 True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "name = \"Hari\" # str\n",
    "age = 20 # int\n",
    "height = 5.8 # float\n",
    "is_student = True # boolean\n",
    "print(name,age,height,is_student)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7c1f0d48-c46b-459f-a954-1256071417ea",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Datatype\n",
    "\n",
    "### A dataype defines what type of value must be stored in an variable\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Python has several built-in data types. The most commonly used basic data types are:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fa9dafa8-9044-4d37-995e-20acf9e8bde8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1. int (Integer)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "e6975874-3ec5-4936-bc27-5474e5c2ce09",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "20"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 5,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "age = 20\n",
    "age\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3a52420f-3f0c-4671-b6b2-2d4a1b7896c3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2.str (String)\n",
    "#### Used to store text or a sequence of characters."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "a761cbae-5723-48d3-ae8f-15c29128700b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'Hari'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 4,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "name = \"Hari\"\n",
    "name"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a9c8b09e-83e8-4969-a117-44a0e37e69f4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 3. float (Floating Point)\n",
    "#### Used to store decimal numbers."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "e2cb7eb9-4318-462a-af05-4b7894d3f0d4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "5.8"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 7,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "height = 5.8\n",
    "height"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "83b1c950-e9c8-45f1-8e69-77a6d5ff900c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 4. bool (Boolean)\n",
    "####          Used to store either True or false\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "564dc029-26e9-4ace-b78b-c270069a008a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "True"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 10,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "is_student = True\n",
    "is_student"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e45b0a6f-bea8-43b4-9e70-e592c24fdffe",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Checking Data Type\n",
    "#### Python uses the type() function to check the type"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "d84afe12-fe7f-4948-96b1-793701204109",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "int"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 15,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "age = 20\n",
    "(type(age))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b0e46e41-1487-408b-8163-14e33f2be319",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Operators\n",
    "\n",
    "## An operator is a symbol or keyword used to perform a specific operation on values or variables.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.Arthimetic operator\n",
    "### +, -, /, //(Floor division),%(mod),"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "b1c06640-3876-4eb9-9686-9b0198b11a6b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "2"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 16,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# mod\n",
    "x=2\n",
    "y=4\n",
    "x%y"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "dbb93170-505d-41af-80ec-5180a7927f03",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "0"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 17,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#floordivison\n",
    "x=2\n",
    "y=4\n",
    "x//y"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "f77252f2-1b92-4d3f-a9a4-e846566695bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "0.5"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 18,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#division\n",
    "x=2\n",
    "y=4\n",
    "x/y"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "id": "d62fc1bc-3f31-450e-b2bb-8fda1ea7fb89",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "16"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 19,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x=2\n",
    "y=4\n",
    "x**y"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cb9158bd-e363-4d17-8b57-57fbe5340628",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.Comparison operator\n",
    "### ==,!=,<,>,<=,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "id": "4124a1f2-1c8a-41b2-9fca-add3b3d24013",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "False\n",
      "True\n",
      "True\n",
      "False\n",
      "True\n",
      "False\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x = 4\n",
    "y = 6\n",
    "print(x==y)\n",
    "print(x!=y)\n",
    "print(x<y)\n",
    "print(x>y)\n",
    "print(x<=y)\n",
    "print(x>=y)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "875547c4-da4d-40cc-bec8-34ccfaff96f5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3.Logical operators\n",
    "### and,or,not"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 22,
   "id": "877bd67e-a2bb-4290-b8f8-5f28b0e6bd63",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "False"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 22,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#and\n",
    "x = True\n",
    "y = False\n",
    "x and y"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "id": "2bff7cfd-3735-4a7b-a6c9-af49a6eaa9c0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "True"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 24,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#or\n",
    "x = True\n",
    "y = False\n",
    "z = False\n",
    "x or y or z"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 26,
   "id": "e2d86fa4-f4bd-4e66-b2b2-2ef4d5ef8c48",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "False"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 26,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#not\n",
    "x = True\n",
    "not x"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1e6a712b-0f13-49d0-91a3-16fc1a54fe0b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4.Assissgnment Operator\n",
    "### Assigning\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
